%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_07_CfoSecurityDisagreement
  questionId: CTX-07
  category: 0
  speakerName: Hiring Manager
  questionText: >-
    The security team wants faster detection, but the CFO says the priority is audit cost and tool consolidation. How do you keep both sides in the conversation?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_07_A1
  answerText: >-
    Build a shared decision frame covering detection impact, consolidation savings, and what evidence each stakeholder needs.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 3
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_07_A2
  answerText: >-
    Side with security because technical risk should drive the buying process.
  technicalDelta: 2
  commercialDelta: -2
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_07_A3
  answerText: >-
    Ask the CFO for budget constraints first and promise the technical team you will come back to detection later.
  technicalDelta: -1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 0
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_07_A4
  answerText: >-
    Admit the goals may conflict, then ask which trade-off they are already making today.
  technicalDelta: 0
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: 0
